2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]   changed — these are data-plumbing and reporting only.
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO] 
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]   (1) SHIM 1-MINUTE RESAMPLING (item 3). upstox_kite_shim.historical_data() now
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       builds TODAY's 5m/15m/1h bars from 1-MINUTE intraday instead of asking the
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       intraday endpoint for them directly, because that endpoint only emits a
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       forming bar 0-6 min late and the engines read iloc[-2] assuming iloc[-1]
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       is the forming bar. Deliberately NOT raising the 16-min stale guard —
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       that would hide stale indicators instead of surfacing them.
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       52/52 instrument-day-interval combos reproduce Upstox's own O/H/L/C/vol/OI
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       EXACTLY. See upstox_kite_shim.py CHANGE_HISTORY.  [FIX]
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO] 
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]   (2) EXPIRY "WHY / WHY NOT" TELEGRAM at 15:29 (item 5). User: "no message about
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       why a trade was not taken". Every EXP12 gate now increments a counter
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       (_exp12_block) and records the closest miss (_exp12_near);
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       _exp12_eod_report() sends one consolidated per-engine message. On the
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       08-27 book this renders as "EXP2: no trade — blocked by spot too far from
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       strike x148 ... closest: 77400CE prem 12.30 OK but dist -318", which is
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       the universe flaw made visible.  [USER]
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO] 
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]   (3) EXP12 TELEGRAM COLOUR + SHADOW TAG (item 7a). Entries/exits were plain
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       🎯/⚫ with no green/red, so a +Rs3,378 day on 08-27 read like nothing had
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       happened. Now 🟢/🔴 by CE/PE, 🟩/🟥 by result, and a persistent
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO]       "⚫ SHADOW BOOK (not in main PnL)" tag.  [USER]
2026-09-01 03:36:04,567 [INFO] 
